ng been able  to mix with them on something like equal  terms  last point of business is a hair update  because this never otherwise makes it  into frame in fact it's pretty hard to  get it in now  but yes i do have absurdly long hair  no i haven't had a haircut for probably  10 years  and yeah it's probably  just down to my knees at the moment or  just passed  but there you go that's a hair update  thanks for watching this video and  thanks to my patreon supporters a  special shout out to today's patreon dog  of the day yoyo  you

